          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चोखो (chokho) is a tadbhava, a word inherited from Sanskrit and reshaped by sound change. It comes from cokṣa, \"pure, clean\". CDIAL lists Old Marwari cokha under it (CDIAL 4918). The Old Marwari row means \"well\"."
